note Forge and Radicle link data shared by every page module, so it loads before them (texts must be
note declared before use; the functions over them live in om/site/radicle.om). rdallow is the public
note table of RadPublish's RIDS.md, name and RID per row; radicle.om checks data/radicle-rids.md against it.
