note Forge links (Drake, 2026-11-09): no link leaves for GitHub except the front door. A repository
note link is FORGE/<repo> for a repo named in rdallow, or the rosa radicle.network page of a public
note RID. A receipt anchor to FORGE/<repo>/(commit|blob|tree)/<7-40 hex> is followed by the plain
note text " <code>rad:<RID> <sha></code>", RID from rdallow, so the receipt survives either host.
note Oracle: crates/site-builder (forge helper). Ranges are decoded JSON bytes in sjdec.
